OL,3,GNEWSAUncertainty for international
OL,4,Apupils after school closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternational students living at a
OL,7,Fprivate school that closed down
OL,8,Fsuddenly have been left scrambling to
OL,9,Ffind alternate arrangements, a teacher
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FLeweston School, an independent
OL,13,Fday-and-boarding school in Dorset,
OL,14,Fhoused more than 20 international
OL,15,Fstudents.
OL,17,FHolly Quick, its former director of
OL,18,Finternational students, said some had
OL,19,Fbeen forced to return home abroad or
OL,20,Fleft with their visa status in limbo.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
