OL,3,GNEWSAUncertainty for international
OL,4,Apupils after school closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FHugh Dickinson, the CEO of Concept
OL,7,FEducation, which took over the school
OL,8,Fin December, said there was now a
OL,9,Ftransition team in place and such
OL,10,Fqueries would be dealt with urgently.
